      "title": "Any user can delete any other user",
      "description": "The before_action on line 2 exempts destroy from require_admin. The destroy action then looks up any user by params[:id] without a scope. Any authenticated user can delete every account, including admin accounts. Remove destroy from the require_admin exception list so only admins reach this action.",
