      "title": "Welcome email sent on every save",
      "description": "The model registers send_welcome_email as an after_save callback. Rails runs after_save on every update as well as on create. Each profile update sends the user another welcome email. That includes the new profile endpoint. Register the callback with after_create_commit so it runs once, after the record is committed.",
